Comparing the outputs generated by ClaudeAI and ChatGPT revealed distinct differences in how each tool organizes and refines identical resume data. 
ClaudeAI adhered strictly to the provided categories without adding unrequested sections, automatically noted "Expected graduation: 
2027", aligned dates cleanly on the right, and fit the entire resume onto a single page, though several two-line bullet points made the clinical experience section appear dense. 
Conversely, ChatGPT expanded the structure by introducing a Professional Summary and a Personal Attributes section alongside Clinical Experience, Education, 
Clinical & Professional Skills, and Training & Activities. Because ChatGPT used direct, recruiter-friendly phrasing within a clean single-column navy-accented format, 
its output was selected as the final resume version
